#EVAL `the residential tenancy agreement is terminated` `written agreement to terminate`
#EVAL `the residential tenancy agreement is terminated` `one tenant's family violence notice`
#EVAL `a particular tenant's interest is terminated` `one tenant's family violence notice`
#EVAL `the agreement remains in force in respect of any other tenant` `one tenant's family violence notice`
#EVAL `the lessor's notice of termination is in the form required by section 61` `valid form lessor notice`
#EVAL `the lessor's notice upon breach is effectual` `breach notice with 14 day remedy`
#EVAL `the lessor's notice upon breach is effectual` `breach notice without prior remedy notice`
#EVAL `the lessor's notice without any ground is effectual` `no ground 60 day notice`
#EVAL `the lessor's notice without any ground is effectual` `no ground notice during fixed term`
#EVAL `the lessor's notice without any ground is effectual` `no ground notice while s.32 order in force`
#EVAL `the tenant's notice without any ground is effectual` `tenant 21 day notice`
#EVAL `the tenant's notice without any ground is effectual` `tenant notice during fixed term`
#EVAL `the rent shall abate accordingly` `uninhabitable not from breach`
#EVAL `a notice of termination under section 70A has been given` `lessor 70A on expiry`
#EVAL `the term of the agreement ends on the expiry day` `lessor 70A on expiry`
#EVAL `a notice of termination under section 70A has been given` `no 70A notice`
#EVAL `the term of the agreement ends on the expiry day` `no 70A notice`
#EVAL `a notice of termination under section 70A has been given` `lessor 70A possession before expiry`
#EVAL `the notice is not ineffectual under section 70` `periodic notice short at law`
#EVAL `that demand proceeding or acceptance operates as a waiver of that breach or that notice` TRUE
#ASSERT `the residential tenancy agreement is terminated` `written agreement to terminate` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the residential tenancy agreement is terminated` `one tenant's family violence notice` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a particular tenant's interest is terminated` `one tenant's family violence notice` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the lessor's notice upon breach is effectual` `breach notice with 14 day remedy` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the lessor's notice upon breach is effectual` `breach notice without prior remedy notice` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the lessor's notice without any ground is effectual` `no ground 60 day notice` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the lessor's notice without any ground is effectual` `no ground notice during fixed term` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the lessor's notice without any ground is effectual` `no ground notice while s.32 order in force` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the tenant's notice without any ground is effectual` `tenant 21 day notice` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the tenant's notice without any ground is effectual` `tenant notice during fixed term` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the term of the agreement ends on the expiry day` `lessor 70A on expiry` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the term of the agreement ends on the expiry day` `no 70A notice` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a notice of termination under section 70A has been given` `lessor 70A possession before expiry` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `that demand proceeding or acceptance operates as a waiver of that breach or that notice` TRUE EQUALS FALSE
